# Dragonfly Titan Simulator: archived flat paddle rotor blade (NASA model, until 2026-10-08).
# Units: metres. Y is up; the blade lies flat in the rotor plane (no thickness, no twist).
# Radius 0.0675 to 0.675 m from the hub axis; scaled for the published 1.35 m rotor.
# Original shape in dist/chase-vehicle.mjs (still used by the original demo model).
# Three blades 120 degrees apart, as on each of the eight rotors.
